    read:`<div class="exam-panel" style="--c:167,139,250;"><header class="ep-h"><span class="ep-tag">lectura · The Paradox of Choice</span><span class="ep-count">4 preguntas</span></header><div class="reading-text" style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:12px;max-height:160px;overflow-y:auto;"><b>The Paradox of Choice</b><br>In his seminal work, psychologist Barry Schwartz argues that an abundance of options, far from liberating individuals, paradoxically diminishes wellbeing. When presented with excessive choice, consumers experience what Schwartz terms 'decision paralysis' — an inability to commit to any single option for fear of making a suboptimal selection. Furthermore, even after making a decision, individuals who have more alternatives are prone to greater post-decision regret, as they remain acutely aware of the roads not taken. This phenomenon challenges the prevailing economic assumption that maximising options inherently maximises utility, suggesting instead that constraints on choice can paradoxically enhance satisfaction.</div><div class="tf-q"><p style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;">Schwartz argues that more choice always improves wellbeing.</p><div class="tf-btns"><button class="tf-btn" data-val="T">TRUE</button><button class="tf-btn" data-val="F">FALSE</button></div></div><div class="tf-q"><p style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;">Decision paralysis occurs when people have too many options.</p><div class="tf-btns"><button class="tf-btn" data-val="T">TRUE</button><button class="tf-btn" data-val="F">FALSE</button></div></div><div class="tf-q"><p style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;">People with fewer choices experience more regret.</p><div class="tf-btns"><button class="tf-btn" data-val="T">TRUE</button><button class="tf-btn" data-val="F">FALSE</button></div></div><div class="tf-q"><p style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;">Constraints on choice can sometimes increase satisfaction.</p><div class="tf-btns"><button class="tf-btn" data-val="T">TRUE</button><button class="tf-btn" data-val="F">FALSE</button></div></div></div>`,
    vocab:`<div class="exam-panel" id="vtask1" style="--c:91,233,246;"><header class="ep-h"><span class="ep-tag">tarea 1 · uso en contexto</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);">¿en cuál se usa correctamente "<b style='color:var(--ink)'>Pragmatic</b>"?</span></header><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;"><button class="hc-opt selected"><b>A</b><span>Dealing with things practically rather than ideologically.</span></button><button class="hc-opt"><b>B</b><span>Idealistic and detached from real-world concerns.</span></button><button class="hc-opt"><b>C</b><span>Overly emotional and irrational in decision-making.</span></button><button class="hc-opt"><b>D</b><span>Rigid and unwilling to adapt to circumstances.</span></button></div></div><div class="exam-panel" id="vtask2" style="--c:91,233,246;"><header class="ep-h"><span class="ep-tag">tarea 2 · familia de palabras</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);">elige la forma correcta</span></header><p style="font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:8px;">"The situation called for <span class="blank">_____</span> rather than idealism."</p><div class="fam-pills" style="display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;"><button class="fam-pill selected" style="background:var(--c-vocab);color:#0a1a1e;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:none;">pragmatism</button><button class="fam-pill" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 13px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);">pragmatic</button><button class="fam-pill" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 13px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);">pragmatically</button></div><p style="font-size:12.5px;margin:10px 0 8px;">"They approached the conflict <span class="blank">_____</span> rather than emotionally."</p><div class="fam-pills" style="display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;"><button class="fam-pill selected" style="background:var(--c-vocab);color:#0a1a1e;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:none;">pragmatically</button><button class="fam-pill" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 13px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);">pragmatism</button><button class="fam-pill" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 13px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);">pragmatic</button></div></div>`,
